PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent (#00000000)
Stroke: 4px Black (#000000FF)
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White (#FFFFFFFF)
Grid: 100px major, 20px minor, 20% opacity

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Manifold Patch
    - Smooth curved surface, consistent with F1–F4
  L2: Graph Structure
    - Nodes v0, v1, v2
    - Edges drawn as straight arrows
    - Graph drawn floating above manifold
  L3: Embedding Map
    - Arrows from each node v_i to points p_i on the manifold
    - 6px stroke, bright blue (#00A0FFFF)
  L4: Labels
    - "Graph G"
    - "Embedding ι : V → M"
    - "ι(v_i) = p_i"
  L5: Annotation Overlay
    - Text: "Adjacency ↦ Geodesic Proximity"

Export:
  PNG (RGBA), sRGB
